-- language: Lua, target: Roblox (detecta server/client automaticamente)
-- Painel adaptativo: server → RemoteEvent + GUI em cada PlayerGui; client → GUI local
-- Fix: CellPadding em todos os UIGridLayout é UDim2 (não UDim)

local RunService = game:GetService("RunService")
local Players = game:GetService("Players")
local RS = game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage")
local IS_SERVER = RunService:IsServer()
local LP = Players.LocalPlayer

local function getHum(p)
    local c = p and p.Character
    return c and c:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
end
local function getHRP(p)
    local c = p and p.Character
    return c and c:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
end

-- ============================================================
-- SERVER HANDLERS
-- ============================================================
local HS = {}

HS.kick = function(_, a)
    local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or "")
    if t then t:Kick(a.reason or "kicked") end
end
HS.kill = function(_, a) local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local h = getHum(t); if h then h.Health = 0 end end
HS.heal = function(_, a) local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local h = getHum(t); if h then h.Health = h.MaxHealth end end
HS.god = function(_, a) local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local h = getHum(t); if h then h.MaxHealth = math.huge; h.Health = math.huge end end
HS.ungod = function(_, a) local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local h = getHum(t); if h then h.MaxHealth = 100; h.Health = 100 end end
HS.speed = function(_, a) local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local h = getHum(t); if h then h.WalkSpeed = tonumber(a.value) or 16 end end
HS.jump = function(_, a) local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local h = getHum(t); if h then h.JumpPower = tonumber(a.value) or 50 end end
HS.damage = function(_, a) local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local h = getHum(t); if h then h:TakeDamage(tonumber(a.value) or 10) end end
HS.freeze = function(_, a) local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local r = getHRP(t); if r then r.Anchored = true end end
HS.unfreeze = function(_, a) local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local r = getHRP(t); if r then r.Anchored = false end end
HS.invisible = function(_, a) local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local c = t and t.Character; if c then for _, v in ipairs(c:GetDescendants()) do if v:IsA("BasePart") then v.Transparency = 1 end end end end
HS.visible = function(_, a) local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local c = t and t.Character; if c then for _, v in ipairs(c:GetDescendants()) do if v:IsA("BasePart") and v.Name ~= "HumanoidRootPart" then v.Transparency = 0 end end end end
HS.fling = function(_, a)
    local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local r = getHRP(t); if not r then return end
    local bv = Instance.new("BodyVelocity")
    bv.Velocity = Vector3.new(math.random(-1500,1500), math.random(500,3000), math.random(-1500,1500))
    bv.MaxForce = Vector3.new(math.huge,math.huge,math.huge)
    bv.Parent = r
    task.delay(2, function() if bv then bv:Destroy() end end)
end

HS.explode = function(_, a)
    local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local r = getHRP(t); if not r then return end
    local ex = Instance.new("Explosion")
    ex.BlastRadius = 25; ex.BlastPressure = 500000; ex.Position = r.Position; ex.Parent = workspace
end
HS.spin = function(_, a)
    local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local r = getHRP(t); if not r then return end
    local av = Instance.new("BodyAngularVelocity")
    av.AngularVelocity = Vector3.new(0,50,0); av.MaxTorque = Vector3.new(math.huge,math.huge,math.huge)
    av.Parent = r
    task.delay(5, function() if av then av:Destroy() end end)
end
HS.rainbow = function(_, a)
    local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local c = t and t.Character; if not c then return end
    task.spawn(function()
        for i = 1, 200 do
            if not c.Parent then return end
            local hue = ((tick()*0.4 + i*0.05) % 1)
            for _, v in ipairs(c:GetDescendants()) do
                if v:IsA("BasePart") then pcall(function() v.Color = Color3.fromHSV(hue,1,1) end) end
            end
            task.wait(0.08)
        end
    end)
end
HS.size = function(_, a)
    local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local h = getHum(t); if not h then return end
    local n = tonumber(a.size) or 1
    pcall(function() h.BodyDepthScale.Value = n end)
    pcall(function() h.BodyWidthScale.Value = n end)
    pcall(function() h.BodyHeightScale.Value = n end)
    pcall(function() h.HeadScale.Value = n end)
end
HS.headthrow = function(_, a)
    local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local c = t and t.Character; if not c then return end
    local head = c:FindFirstChild("Head"); if not head then return end
    head.Anchored = false; head.CanCollide = false
    local bv = Instance.new("BodyVelocity")
    bv.Velocity = Vector3.new(math.random(-200,200), 150, math.random(-200,200))
    bv.MaxForce = Vector3.new(math.huge,math.huge,math.huge)
    bv.Parent = head
end
HS.ragdoll = function(_, a)
    local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local c = t and t.Character; if not c then return end
    for _, v in ipairs(c:GetDescendants()) do
        if v:IsA("Motor6D") then
            pcall(function()
                local a0 = Instance.new("Attachment", v.Part0)
                local a1 = Instance.new("Attachment", v.Part1)
                local bs = Instance.new("BallSocketConstraint")
                bs.Attachment0 = a0; bs.Attachment1 = a1; bs.Parent = v.Part0
                v:Destroy()
            end)
        end
    end
end
HS.fire = function(_, a)
    local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local r = getHRP(t); if not r then return end
    local f = Instance.new("Fire"); f.Size = 15; f.Heat = 20; f.Parent = r
    task.delay(6, function() if f then f:Destroy() end end)
end
HS.nuke = function(_, a)
    local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local r = getHRP(t); if not r then return end
    local pos = r.Position
    local ex = Instance.new("Explosion")
    ex.BlastRadius = 120; ex.BlastPressure = 2000000; ex.Position = pos; ex.Parent = workspace
    for _, v in ipairs(workspace:GetDescendants()) do
        if v:IsA("BasePart") and v ~= r and (v.Position-pos).Magnitude < 120 then
            pcall(function() v:Destroy() end)
        end
    end
end
HS.skyfall = function(_, a) local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local r = getHRP(t); if r then r.CFrame = r.CFrame + Vector3.new(0,1500,0) end end
HS.yeet = function(_, a)
    local t = Players:FindFirstChild(a.target or ""); local r = getHRP(t); if not r then return end
    local bv = Instance.new("BodyVelocity")
    bv.Velocity = Vector3.new(math.random(-800,800), 6000, math.random(-800,800))
    bv.MaxForce = Vector3.new(math.huge,math.huge,math.huge)
    bv.Parent = r
    task.delay(4, function() if bv then bv:Destroy() end end)
end

HS.clearWorkspace = function() for _, v in ipairs(workspace:GetChildren()) do if v:IsA("Model") or v:IsA("BasePart") then pcall(function() v:Destroy() end) end end end
HS.killAll = function() for _, p in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do local h = getHum(p); if h then pcall(function() h.Health = 0 end) end end end
HS.breakAll = function() for _, v in ipairs(workspace:GetDescendants()) do if v:IsA("BasePart") then pcall(function() v.Anchored = false; v.CanCollide = false end) end end end
HS.anchorAll = function() for _, v in ipairs(workspace:GetDescendants()) do if v:IsA("BasePart") then pcall(function() v.Anchored = true end) end end end
HS.unanchorAll = function() for _, v in ipairs(workspace:GetDescendants()) do if v:IsA("BasePart") then pcall(function() v.Anchored = false end) end end end
HS.lagServer = function()
    for _ = 1, 50 do
        task.spawn(function()
            local p = Instance.new("Part")
            p.Size = Vector3.new(80,80,80)
            p.Position = Vector3.new(math.random(-800,800), math.random(100,800), math.random(-800,800))
            p.Anchored = false; p.BrickColor = BrickColor.random(); p.Parent = workspace
            task.delay(3, function() if p then p:Destroy() end end)
        end)
    end
end
HS.kickAll = function(requester) for _, p in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do if p ~= requester then pcall(function() p:Kick("wiped") end) end end end
HS.shutdown = function()
    for _, p in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do pcall(function() p:Kick("shutdown") end) end
    task.wait(0.5)
    pcall(function() game:Shutdown() end)
end
HS.gravity = function(_, a) workspace.Gravity = tonumber(a.value) or 196.2 end
HS.broadcast = function(requester, a)
    local msg = tostring(a.msg or "hi")
    for _, p in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do
        local hint = Instance.new("Hint")
        hint.Text = "[" .. (requester and requester.Name or "MI") .. "] " .. msg
        hint.Parent = workspace
        task.delay(5, function() if hint then hint:Destroy() end end)
    end
end
HS.giveTools = function()
    for _, p in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do
        local bp = p:FindFirstChild("Backpack")
        if bp then
            local tool = Instance.new("Tool")
            tool.Name = "MI_Sword"; tool.RequiresHandle = true
            local handle = Instance.new("Part")
            handle.Name = "Handle"; handle.Size = Vector3.new(1,1,4)
            handle.BrickColor = BrickColor.new("Really red"); handle.Material = Enum.Material.Neon
            handle.Parent = tool; tool.Parent = bp
        end
    end
end

